{"explanation": "The unit responds mostly to vehicles (vans, buses, emergency trucks, cars, grilles) and some wading shorebirds. Within those classes, the composition effects are weak and none reach the 95th percentile. The unit leans toward large subjects that fill most of the frame and are partly cut off. It also leans toward photos with a color tint (warm or cool) over neutral ones, toward a brightly lit single subject, and toward level lines over tilted ones. The tilt and warm-tint effects are partly shared with the similar units. Subject size, cool tint and bright lighting look more particular to this unit.", "rows": [8, 12, 21, 19]}
```

